	"is_virtual": false,
	"web_text": "Among the Tuareg, the traditionally nomadic inhabitants of the Sahara Desert, voluminous clothing is considered the most beautiful. The women of Agadez wear a short and ample blouse known as an afetek, which is stitched at the corners to hold the front and back together, with a slit in the center for the neck opening. It is accented with simple bands of red, green, and yellow cotton embroidery that draw attention to the wearer's facial features.",
	"didactic_label": "Among the Tuareg, the traditionally nomadic inhabitants of the Sahara Desert, voluminous clothing is considered the most beautiful. The women of Agadez wear a short and ample blouse known as an afetek, which is stitched at the corners to hold the front and back together, with a slit in the center for the neck opening. It is accented with simple bands of red, green, and yellow cotton embroidery that draw attention to the wearer's facial features.",
